Package: dbn
Type: Package
Title: Dynamic Bilinear Network Models for Relational Data
Version: 1.2.0
Date: 2026-05-28
Authors@R: c(
    person("Tosin", "Salau", email = "salaubol@msu.edu",
           role = "aut"),
    person("Shahryar", "Minhas", email = "minhassh@msu.edu",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
Author: Tosin Salau [aut], Shahryar Minhas [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Shahryar Minhas <minhassh@msu.edu>
Description: Implements Dynamic Bilinear Network (DBN) models for analyzing
    temporal relational data. Supports ordinal (rank likelihood), continuous
    (Gaussian), and binary (probit) outcome types across static, dynamic,
    piecewise, low-rank, and HMM model variants for both unipartite and
    bipartite directed networks. Includes functions for model estimation via
    MCMC, visualization, impulse response analysis, and diagnostics.
URL: https://netify-dev.github.io/dbn/,
    https://github.com/netify-dev/dbn
BugReports: https://github.com/netify-dev/dbn/issues
